# Production build defaults for the frontend.
#
# In production the ingress serves `/api` -> backend and `/` -> frontend on the SAME host (same origin), so the
# frontend must call the backend with RELATIVE paths (`/api/...`), not an absolute URL. An empty VITE_API_BASE_URL
# makes every `${API_BASE_URL}/api/...` request resolve to the current origin.
#
# Vite loads this file automatically during `pnpm build` (see https://vite.dev/guide/env-and-mode#env-files).
# A VITE_API_BASE_URL build argument overrides it (docker-compose does, for the local stack).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
